# Keep every file byte-for-byte as committed on all platforms: no line-ending
# conversion anywhere. Authored text (Go, JavaScript, HTML, Markdown, YAML,
# Python, shell) is committed with LF line endings.
#
# Deliberate exceptions that contain CR LF and must stay exactly as they are:
# - internal/capture/testdata/**: byte-exact native Windows console traces
#   (raw.bin, screen.bin), their SHA256.json manifests (UTF-8 with BOM, CRLF)
#   and fifty-cases.json; the tests replay and hash these bytes;
# - internal/hooks/powershell.ps1: the PowerShell hook embedded in the binary
#   and delivered to Windows shells; kept CRLF so the shipped hook is unchanged.
* -text

*.png  binary
*.bin  binary
